Package: mintyrasr
Title: Run 'mintyr' GBLUP Cross-Validation Scenarios Directly in 'ASReml-R'
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Guo Meng", email = "tony2015116@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits single- and two-trait models with 'ASReml-R' - pedigree
    BLUP, GBLUP or single-step GBLUP, with repeatability, maternal, litter
    and genotype x environment effects - to the nested parameter-estimation
    and cross-validation data built by 'mintyr' (cv_scenarios(), nest_cv(),
    w2l_nest(), c2p_nest()). Heritabilities, genetic and phenotypic
    correlations and variance proportions are built from the names of the
    variance components, so they follow the model. Variance components can be
    fixed, warm-started or re-estimated in every fold, and the package reports
    GEBV reliabilities, predictive ability, accuracy and regression slope, so
    no input files have to be exported.
